    "title": "Listening",
    "notes": "What about the modular course? What would I have to do for that.\n\nThat's why you get the opportunity to study full time for short period. That way you can cover a lot of coursework and attend lectures and seminars during the time. And, each module last for one term, say about 12 weeks of the time. There obviously advantages in this. The main will be you can study in a much intensive way which suits some people much better.\n\nHow many of these modules would I have to do to get the diploma?\n\nCurren program is two modules.And, Then you have to choose a topic to work in more depth.\n\nBut, you can base at your job and so you don't need to away from your office. And, how long it takes up to you. You don't have to study at work, focus on one thing at a time.\n\nYes I can see that. It's sound attractive. Would be more expensive though.",
